{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd1eSo, me and guys got together and made our very first horror game! We tried as hard as we could, but the result... Well, there were goosebumps! Whether from fear or from shame, we still don\u2019t know =)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddff So, the game is about a professional urbex who went where he shouldn\u2019t have!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude93 In the best tradition of first-person puzzle horror, you will wander in the dark, find keys to locked doors, and escape from attacking mannequins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/b6de35a1d94750e053f9d868b0d9f96f.poster.avif?t=1756918831\" width=914 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/b6de35a1d94750e053f9d868b0d9f96f.webm?t=1756918831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccb Search for mysterious notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 There\u2019s some kind of meaning and keys for doors everywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/0b6a661f0690ebc91cffb0f8d5b37e9c.poster.avif?t=1756918831\" width=914 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/0b6a661f0690ebc91cffb0f8d5b37e9c.webm?t=1756918831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/0b6a661f0690ebc91cffb0f8d5b37e9c.mp4?t=1756918831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddfb Explore the atmospheric abandoned factory<br>\ud83d\udea8 Avoid deadly mannequins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 Beware of the darkness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/3778face7566f02350ba89c4084f7556.poster.avif?t=1756918831\" width=914 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880220/extras/3778face7566f02350ba89c4084f7556.webm?t=1756918831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae We made the gameplay full of events and dynamic! Without dragging the game out with empty 8+ hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude93 Will you uncover the factory\u2019s secret? Is it possible to survive there?! Let\u2019s go, let\u2019s figure it out!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the plant, buddy! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880220/fc95c096598721b2a8b01c92fe7dc6030a922dab.jpg"},{"name":"What happened here?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880220/1554abb287225d193f1dc3ad1be4e6e60e709a3f.jpg"},{"name":"Warm welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880220/ddca6d131ac6bc6e916f53fa1acc6f669fd3db26.jpg"},{"name":"\u0421rash test completed successfully","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880220/0bfeba5f15cca56e7a0a0f050700b32f108058c9.jpg"},{"name":"Is this the right way?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880220/c560dd3d9143c0b3a44c55ce7182f6efb2c3281e.jpg"},{"name":"What's for dinner tonight?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880220/4ad9ccdb6b2d69778ed0e2